                                                                            <td><p align="justify">Prof (Dr) Kaushalya (Kaushal Panwar),hails from Kaithal District in Haryana. She completed her graduation from Kaithal and later studied for her Masters in Sanskrit from Kurukshetra University, Master in Hindi from Vinayaka Missions University Salem Tamilnadu, M.Phil.fromMaharishiDayanandUniversity Rohtak,Haryana. She obtained her doctorate in Sanskrit from JNU, New Delhi.</br>
