<p align="justify">She is the member of the following professional bodies like:The Member of Telephone advisory committee for Delhi West Telecom Distric Department of Telecommunications, PHP section, Ministry of Communication, Government of India. External Subject member (As a special Invitee) of the board of the studies of the department of Sanskrit, School of Humanities and Languages mahatma Gandhi central University Motihari Patna Bihar (From 23rd November 2021 till date). The External Member of Board of the studies of the faculty of modern Indian language of Shri Jagadish Prasad JhabarmalTibrewalaUniversity  JJTU Rajasthan from 27Th January 2019 to till date. Non- Official Independent Director on the board of Directors of Hindustan Antibiotics Limited (HAL) Government of India Enterprise, Pimpri Pune-411017 from 26Th June 2024 to till date (For the period of three Years).Executive Council Member (EC), Dr.Babasaheb Ambedkar Open University, Ahmedabad Gujrat form 2023 to till date. The Member of the Sub Committee of Board of Management (Nominated Member) for Uniform Model Status as per Section 21 (4) of the Gujrat Public University Act 202, Dr. Babasaheb Ambedkar Open University Ahmadabad, Gujrat from 5th February 2024 to till date.Member of Academic Counci in Tezpur University Tezpur, ASSAM, INDIA  from (03) years w.e.f. 29.10.2024.</br>
